{"version":3,"kind":"Notebook","sha256":"74ca6fcc79138408af385e7eafc0f57b0f7e42ba9f346c873fde13720d9295bf","slug":"chromatin-accessibility.introduction","location":"/chromatin_accessibility/introduction.ipynb","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"单细胞 ATAC-seq","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Christopher Lance","given":"Christopher","family":"Lance"},"name":"Christopher Lance","id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-0"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Laura Martens","given":"Laura","family":"Martens"},"name":"Laura Martens","id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-1"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Lukas Heumos","given":"Lukas","family":"Heumos"},"name":"Lukas Heumos","roles":["Writing – review & editing"],"id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-2"}],"content_includes_title":false,"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3 (ipykernel)","language":"python"},"github":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices","settings":{"output_matplotlib_strings":"remove"},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/blob/main/.build/v2-candidate/community-notice-2026-09-16-02/overlay/chromatin_accessibility/introduction.ipynb","edit_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/edit/main/.build/v2-candidate/community-notice-2026-09-16-02/overlay/chromatin_accessibility/introduction.ipynb","thumbnail":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/mechanisms_overview-30644a3e96c24654066548c29faebc4f.png","exports":[{"format":"ipynb","filename":"introduction.ipynb","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/introduction-09ec3801e38a78bb94a8a92b5fc158a5.ipynb"}]},"widgets":{},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"details","children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🧠 关键要点","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"wjLRD4e489"}],"key":"MNubUwcQWm"},{"type":"card","url":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"染色质可及性（chromatin accessibility）是刻画细胞身份的重要信息，与基因表达谱互为补充。它反映 DNA 甲基化（DNA methylation）、组蛋白修饰（histone modification）和转录因子（Transcription Factor, TF）活性等机制共同作用下的调控状态，这些机制共同影响基因表达与细胞分化。","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"dInniUjqcX"}],"key":"JjYyV38hTm"}],"urlSource":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","key":"RZQHJGLQsc"},{"type":"card","url":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞转座酶可及染色质测序（single-cell assay for transposase-accessible chromatin using sequencing, scATAC-seq）数据高度稀疏：每个细胞的 DNA 拷贝有限，许多特征（feature）的计数（Count）为零。分析时需定义具有生物学意义的 feature，例如峰（peak）或基因组窗口（bin），并注意保留细胞类型特异的可及性信号。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"eyd6TKdCyu"}],"key":"ND6mDa3Ylk"}],"urlSource":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","key":"e4hZjEzo4v"}],"key":"cTkWYnO02k"},{"type":"comment","value":" END DROPDOWNS ","key":"n3RFrBQkgW"}],"key":"RwfPA0tL02"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","data":{"tags":[]},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"研究动机","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"jH3vq15zXo"}],"label":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","identifier":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","html_id":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","key":"r52RtGwzzc"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"同一生物体的大多数体细胞拥有基本相同的基因组，却能形成免疫系统中的自然杀伤细胞、传递电化学信号的神经元等功能迥异的细胞。前几章介绍了如何根据基因表达谱推断细胞身份与功能。基因表达受 DNA 甲基化（DNA methylation）、组蛋白修饰（histone modification）以及转录因子（Transcription Factor, TF）活性等多种机制共同调控。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"KgxFuDAHSb"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"Chromatin","identifier":"term-chromatin","children":[{"type":"text","value":"染色质","key":"n9upXBsc8V"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-chromatin","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"qHtjUREp4t"},{"type":"text","value":" 可及性（chromatin accessibility）反映了这些机制共同作用下的调控状态，为描述细胞身份的 ","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"D9Dtb5D3kf"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"Messenger RNA (mRNA)","identifier":"term-messenger rna (mrna)","children":[{"type":"text","value":"信使 RNA（messenger RNA, mRNA）","key":"y3GBCFG0XC"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-messenger-rna-mrna","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"bykIHJdW84"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平提供互补信息。分析染色质可及性谱，还能揭示单细胞 RNA 测序（Single-Cell RNA Sequencing, scRNA-seq）可能无法捕捉的基因调控机制与细胞分化过程。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"rnqSukMhe0"}],"key":"xTca6gCFvs"}],"visibility":"show","key":"KwavPodSMZ"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","data":{"tags":[]},"children":[{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/mechanisms_overview-30644a3e96c24654066548c29faebc4f.png","alt":"染色质可及性的调控机制","width":"800px","key":"Zj7cm0BtvZ","urlSource":"../_static/images/sc_atac/mechanisms_overview.png"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"capti